\f0\fs24 \cf0 README \'97 REPLICATION FILE\
May 29 2020\
\
This folder contains all replication materials for:  Dietrich, Milner and Slapin \'93From Text to Political Positions on Foreign Aid: Analysis of Aid Mentions in Party Manifestos from 1960 to 2015\'94\
\
All analysis was performed in Stata SE v15.1  \
\
Please place all materials in a single folder and set your working directory to that folder. \
\
The \'93input folder\'94 contains all raw data required. Files are a follows: \
\
\pard\tx566\tx1133\tx1700\tx2267\tx2834\tx3401\tx3968\tx4535\tx5102\tx5669\tx6236\tx6803\pardeftab720\ri0\partightenfactor0

\f1\b \cf0 1) Manifesto_rawcoding.dta \
\pard\tx566\tx1133\tx1700\tx2267\tx2834\tx3401\tx3968\tx4535\tx5102\tx5669\tx6236\tx6803\pardeftab720\ri0\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0 \cf0 contains the coding of the manifesto foreign policy sentences, each by two coders (c1 and c2). The variables are as follows: \
\
cty: Country name\
partyid: Partyid from manifesto data\
year: election year when manifesto was written\
Passage: the text of the sentence being coded. \
aid_c1/c2: 0 if the sentence is not about aid; 1 if the sentence is about aid\
proaid_c1/c2: 1 if the sentence is a pro aid mention, zero otherwise\
negaid_c1/c2: 1 if the sentence is a negative aid mention, zero otherwise\
\
